          "comments": [
            {
              "#text": "本数据集描述了1-35kV中压交流电的产品流，从电力生产、传输到最终供应给使用电力的用户。该数据集专为用户侧的电力使用而设计，反映了多种电力来源的混合，包括化石燃料、核能和可再生能源等不同发电方式的组合。数据集符合国际生命周期数据系统 (ILCD) 的相关规定，满足方法学、数据质量、命名规范、审核和文档等方面的要求，确保数据的准确性和适用性，特别是针对电力用户的环境影响评估。",
              "@xml:lang": "zh"
            },
            {
              "#text": "This dataset describes the product flow of 1-35kV medium voltage alternating current (MVAC) electricity from the point of generation, through transmission, to the final supply to the consumers who use the electricity. The dataset is designed for customer-side electricity use and reflects a mix of multiple electricity sources, including a combination of different generation methods such as fossil fuels, nuclear and renewable energy. The dataset is compliant with the International Life Cycle Data (ILCD) system and meets methodology, data quality, naming conventions, auditing and documentation requirements to ensure accuracy and applicability of the data, particularly for environmental impact assessment of electricity users.",
              "@xml:lang": "en"
            }
          ],
