          "comments": [
            {
              "#text": "Compressed air is air kept under a pressure that is greater than atmospheric pressure. It is an important medium for transfer of energy in industrial processes, and is used for power tools such as air hammers, drills, wrenches, and others. It is also used to atomize paint, to operate air cylinders for automation. Compressed air acts as an energy source for a variety of tools and machinery, and it is often an important part of many production processes.",
              "@xml:lang": "en"
            },
            {
              "#text": "压缩空气是指压力大于大气压力的空气。它是工业生产过程中传递能量的重要介质，可用于气锤、电钻、扳手等电动工具。它还用于雾化油漆、操作自动化气缸。压缩空气是各种工具和机械的能源，通常是许多生产流程的重要组成部分。",
              "@xml:lang": "zh"
            }
          ],
          "CAS": null,
          "classification": {
